      <Comment source="BioCyc">NIL Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid. Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid. Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid. Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid. Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid. Requires cytochrome &lt;i&gt;P&lt;/i&gt;&lt;sub&gt;450&lt;/sub&gt;. Catalyzes three successive oxidations of the 4-methyl group of &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-kaurene giving kaurenoic acid.</Comment>
